  "name": "BSEARCH-pf1",
  "description": "int search ( int A[], int n, int key ) {\n  int b = 0;\n  while ( n > 1 ) {\n    int h = n / 2;\n    __builtin_prefetch(&A[b + h/2]);      // next probe if the key is in the lower half\n    __builtin_prefetch(&A[b + h + h/2]);  // next probe if it is in the upper half\n    b = (A[b+h] < key) ? b+h : b;\n    n = n - h;\n  }\n  return b;\n}",
